# /settings' tabs, a change on the first row and on the sound row, Enter on a
# setting, the search, and Escape (the research `settings2.cap`). Down is
# counted per binary so both land on the sound row: fx lists four settings xfx
# has nothing behind (`.prd/tui-phase4/ssot.md` §Tensions). Both start with
# sound off (fx by the harness's FX_SOUND=0).
xfx: env XFX_SOUND=off
wait 2
type /settings
key Enter
wait 1
key Tab
wait 0.4
snap tab1
key Tab
wait 0.4
snap tab2
key Tab
wait 0.4
snap tab3
key Tab
wait 0.4
snap tab4
key Tab
wait 0.4
snap tab5
key Escape
wait 0.5
type /settings
key Enter
wait 1
key Right
wait 0.5
snap right-context
home right-context
fx: key Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down
xfx: key Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down
wait 0.4
snap down-sound
key Right
wait 0.5
snap sound-right
home sound-right
key Enter
wait 0.8
snap enter
type sou
wait 0.5
snap filter-sou
type zzz
wait 0.5
snap filter-none
key Escape
wait 0.5
snap esc
home files
